{include file="admin/layout/header" /}
<div class="title"><div class="tabs"><a class="active" href="/admin/vod-tools/scenario-collect">分集剧情补全</a><a href="/admin/scenarios">分集剧情管理</a><a href="/admin/vod?missing=scenario">缺剧情视频</a></div><div class="actions"><a href="/admin/collections/create?type=scenario">添加剧情资源库</a><a href="/admin/collections?type=scenario">管理剧情资源库</a></div></div>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table legacy-tool-table"><tbody><tr><th>已有剧情：</th><td>{$mediaCount} 部影片，共 {$total} 集</td></tr><tr><th>待补全：</th><td><strong class="text-danger">{$missing}</strong> 部</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class="title"><div class="tabs"><span>剧情专项采集</span></div></div>
<form class="legacy-tool-control" data-scenario-tool data-endpoint="/admin/vod-tools/scenario-collect/run"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{$csrf|htmlspecialchars|raw}"><label>采集源：<select name="source_id" required><option value="">请选择</option>{volist name="sources" id="source"}<option value="{$source.id}" {if $selectedSourceId == $source.id}selected{/if}>{$source.name|htmlspecialchars|raw} ({if $source.resource_type == 'scenario'}剧情 · {/if}{$source.source_type|htmlspecialchars|raw})</option>{/volist}</select></label><label>起始页：<input class="short-input" name="page" type="number" min="1" value="1"></label><label>每页：<input class="short-input" name="limit" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="20"></label><label>指定远程ID：<input name="ids" placeholder="例如 12,15,18"></label><label>间隔：<input class="short-input" name="delay" type="number" min="500" max="30000" value="1500"> 毫秒</label><button type="button" data-tool-start>开始采集</button><button type="button" data-tool-pause disabled>暂停</button><button type="button" data-tool-reset>重置页码</button><span class="legacy-tool-state" data-tool-state>尚未开始</span></form>
<div class="legacy-tool-help"><p>1：支持 FeiFeiCMS 7.3/7.4 JSON 的独立 scenario 接口，也支持 MacCMS JSON 详情中的 vod_scenario 字段。</p><p>2：只写入独立分集剧情表，并通过采集源的视频ID与本地视频关联；不更改视频资料或播放线路。</p></div>
<div class="legacy-tool-log" data-tool-log><p>执行日志将显示在这里。</p></div>
{include file="admin/layout/footer" /}
